{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108440","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108440","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910844001:1":{"text":"나는 엘피라.","source_cn":"我是艾菲拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6508F92F69088BFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910844002:1":{"text":"타라사의 주민이자, 천해족의 딸!","source_cn":"塔拉萨的子民，浅海裔的女儿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3FBA311F05E2426","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910844003:1":{"text":"안 돼, 떠나면 안 된단다. 나의 의지를 거스르지 말렴!","source_cn":"不……！别离开我，别抗拒我的意志！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F95EEFEFB2840AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910844004:1":{"text":"너는 나의 일부란다. 우리는 하나야!","source_cn":"你是我的一部分，我们是一体！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x617378112BA4E433","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910844005:1":{"text":"어떻게... 나 자신을 버릴 수 있지?","source_cn":"我怎么能……抛弃……自己？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26576082A7E6AC2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910844006:1":{"text":"달이... 빛나고 있어...","source_cn":"月亮……在发光……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x703D669DD6F4BC00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910844007:1":{"text":"밝은... 달빛이...","source_cn":"好明亮的……月光……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26D6B35FBB1B4F97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910844008:1":{"text":"이겨내, 엘피라! 저 여자가 널 빼앗게 두지 마!","source_cn":"赢过她，艾菲拉！别让那家伙夺走你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF9D5CEB30D6213F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1910844008":{"text":"이겨내, 엘피라! 저 여자가 널 빼앗게 두지 마!","source_cn":"赢过她，艾菲拉！别让那家伙夺走你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF9D5CEB30D6213F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910844009:1":{"text":"나... 다 들었어...","source_cn":"我……我听见了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E28F2402EDE31CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910844010:1":{"text":"너희 목소리... 너무 시끄러워...! 그런데... 따뜻해...","source_cn":"你们的声音……好吵……！可是……好温暖……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CA9A17C737B905C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910844011:1":{"text":"我想……我想让大家回来……让阿嬷、姐姐、卡律先生、歌尼特，所有人都回来……","source_cn":"我想……我想让大家回来……让阿嬷、姐姐、卡律先生、歌尼...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC07EE8D215CC415F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910844012:1":{"text":"타라사가 예전 모습으로 돌아갔으면 좋겠어. 심해족들도 마음 놓고 살아갈 수 있으면 좋겠고...","source_cn":"我想让塔拉萨回到原来的样子，我想让深海裔也能安心生活……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EF70D57CC0C5255","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910844013:1":{"text":"하지만... 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어! 오세아나의 간절한 목소리가 아직도 메아리치고 있어. 오세아나도 사라지고 싶지 않은 거잖아!","source_cn":"可是……我不知道该怎么做！奥汐娜，她的恳求还在回响，她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84C714025D9F3C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1910844013":{"text":"하지만... 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어! 오세아나의 간절한 목소리가 아직도 메아리치고 있어. 오세아나도 사라지고 싶지 않은 거잖아!","source_cn":"可是……我不知道该怎么做！奥汐娜，她的恳求还在回响，她也不想消失！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84C714025D9F3C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910844014:1":{"text":"연못지기는 소원이 누군가가 존재했다는 증거라고 했지... 소원을 지키면, 소원도 나를 지켜 준다고...","source_cn":"守池人说，心愿是人存在过的证明……保护心愿，它们也保护我……","status":"matched","hash_